ill strongly encourage ethical hackers to report any vulnerabilities they may find through our platform. We greatly value the contributions of ethical hackers and their efforts to help us maintain a secure environment for our users.\",\"previousPolicy\":\"$20\"},{\"timestamp\":\"2023-01-21T13:36:31.829Z\",\"comments\":\"Added a gif to the policy\\n\",\"previousPolicy\":\"$21\"}],\"isAcceptingBugs\":true,\"isAcceptingDrafts\":true,\"activeCampaigns\":[],\"isBlacklisted\":false,\"hallOfFameUsers\":[],\"hallOfFameTitle\":\"Hall of Fame\",\"publicCurrency\":\"USD\",\"announcements\":[],\"vaultEnabled\":[],\"requireWhitelist\":[],\"vpnEnabled\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"BugBase - Bug Bounty Program | BugBase\",\"metaDescription\":\"BugBase is committed to security and safety for all their users through their Bug Bounty Program at BugBase. Protect your applications and data with BugBase, the #1 Continuous Vulnerability Assessment Platform. Find and fix critical vulnerabilities before they can be exploited and keep your data secure with the help of the hacker community through Bug Bounty Programs.\"},\"notFound\":false,\"isLoggedIn\":false,\"lang\":\"en\"}]\n"])</script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/vce701823e78c4301a35b7e07294d87301792088814092" integrity="sha512-UKNk8GbxkABxKcXYuLkO16EleLGUkcvJWtpSNmExE0Too3ZaFAxTscNWEc1OdAv5/BikHawapSCaiD2XCmp+Bw==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"daed18a0e6ab4abf85ce7ca51f622e9c","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
